3. **Reaction of pentanaldehyde (B) with NaOH:**  
   \[ \text{C}_5\text{H}_{10}\text{O} + \text{NaOH} \rightarrow \text{C}_5\text{H}_9\text{OONa} + \text{NH}_3 \]  

