   \[
   2\varphi = \frac{\omega \pi}{6}
   \]
   Simplifying the second equation:
   \[
   2\omega x = \pi
   \]
   Since $\omega > 0$, we have:
   \[
   x = \frac{\pi}{2\omega}
   \]
   Substituting back into the first equation:
   \[
   2\varphi = \frac{\omega \pi}{6}
   \]
   \[
   \varphi = \frac{\omega \pi}{12}
