\[
0.7(12) + 0.1(12) > -6.8
\]
\[
8.4 + 1.2 > -6.8
\]
\[
9.6 > -6.8
\]
This inequality holds true, so the proportion of millet exceeds half the total seeds after the first addition of seeds. However, the question asks for the day immediately after the replenishment, so the answer is $\boxed{B}$ (Tuesday).

