<start_of_turn>model
","The index of refraction \( n \) is given by the ratio of the speed of light in a vacuum \( c \) to the speed of light in the medium \( v \):
\[
n = \frac{c}{v}
\]
Given that the speed of light in the plastic is \( 0.680c \), the index of refraction is:
\[
n = \frac{c}{0.680c} = \frac{1}{0.680} = 1.43
\]
Thus, the refractive index for light in the plastic is \(\boxed{1.43}\).
