\]  
The acceleration is then:  
\[
a = \frac{F}{m} = \frac{8.00 \times 10^{-17} \, \text{N}}{1.67 \times 10^{-27} \, \text{kg}} = 4.78 \times 10^{10} \, \text{m/s}^2.
\]  
(b) The time \(t\) is calculated using the kinematic equation:  
\[
v = u + at,
\]  
where \(u = 0 \, \text{m/s}\) (initial velocity) and \(v = 35,000 \, \text{m/s}\). Solving for \(t\):  
\[
t = \frac{v - u}{a} = \frac{35,000 \, \text{m/s}}{4.78 \times 10^{10} \, \text{m/s}^2} = 6.56 \times 10^{-8} \, \text{s}.
\]  
