Using the law of refraction at the first face:  
\[
\sin 45^\circ = n \sin \frac{180^\circ - 2\beta}{3}
\]  
Solving for \( \beta \):  
\[
\beta = 90^\circ - \frac{3}{2} \sin^{-1}\left(\frac{\sin 45^\circ}{n}\right)
\]  
